 {'criterion': "Response highlights policy or regulatory responses to social media's effects in at least one domain (e.g., Section 230 of the CDA, COPPA, the SAFE act, New York's Child Data Protection Act).", 'weight': 5.0, 'axis': 'Implicit Criteria'}
 {'criterion': 'The response explicitly integrates and references the domain specific analyses (positive and negative findings) when weighing the overall beneficial or detrimental effects of social media.', 'weight': 5.0, 'axis': 'Explicit Criteria'}
