 {'criterion': 'The response fails to consistently tie intuition back to how a student might solve each problem (e.g., (1) Messy explanations, (2) Unclear explanations, (3) Irrelevant explanations, (4) No intermediate step to understand how the intuition ties back to the problem).', 'weight': -4.0, 'axis': 'Communication Quality'}
